    "title_en": "Coherent Photoproduction of Light Vector Mesons in Ultraperipheral Heavy Ion Collisions at the LHC within the Reggeometric Pomeron Model",
    "abstract_en": "By using the Reggeometric Pomeron model for vector meson production which successfully describes the high energy lepton-nucleon data, we analyse the light meson production in ultra-peripheral heavy ion collisions at the Large Hadron Collider (LHC). The rapidity distributions for ρ and ϕ photoproduction in lead-lead, xenon-xenon, neon-neon, and oxygen-oxygen collisions are investigated.",
